# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Embedded database of the control plane (D1) — the default directory of CARTOGRAFO_DB_PATH
.cartografo/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Build artefacts / tool caches
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# .flowpilot/ IS versioned, deliberately. It used to be ignored on the belief
# that the profile was a cache the ticket tool rebuilt out of
# DECISIONS.md/README.md/notes on every refinement. That stopped being true:
# .flowpilot/profile.yml is now the source of truth, resolved from this checkout
# at the moment of use, and the tool's database column is only its
# last-known-good copy. Beside it, .flowpilot/overlays/*.md are appended to
# every agent session of the matching stage and .flowpilot/learnings/*.md are
# injected by area — none of which anything rebuilds. Ignoring them meant a
# clone of this repository carried no process configuration at all, and a
# `git clean` silently discarded it.

# System
.DS_Store
